What does this program print? (`Console.Write` adds no new line.)

```csharp
static async Task<string> Work(string tag, int ms)
{
    await Task.Delay(ms);
    Console.Write(tag);
    return tag;
}

var t1 = Work("A", 300);
var t2 = Work("B", 100);
Console.Write("C");
string r = await t1 + await t2;
Console.WriteLine(" " + r);
```

