What does this program print?

```csharp
var c = new Counter();
object o = c;
c.Inc();
c.Inc();
((Counter)o).Inc();
Console.WriteLine($"{c.N} {((Counter)o).N}");

struct Counter
{
    public int N;
    public void Inc() => N++;
}
```
